  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at 21.7.13 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 👷 ci: correct a stale checkout pin comment by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3254\n* 🔧 chore: drop misc as a changelog fragment type by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3255\n* 👷 ci: scope the nushell apt key to its own repo by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3253\n* 🐛 fix(activation): stop path command injection in bash and fish by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/pull/3252\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.7.12...21.7.13",
